    "property_title": "Luxury Home for Sale in Pueblo Golf Estates",
    "short_description": "",
    "description": "Price: ₱40,000,000  \r\nLocation: Pueblo Golf Estates, Uptown Cagayan de Oro City  \r\n\r\nThis stunning Fairway Lot 3-level home with a basement is located in one of the most exclusive and prestigious residential enclaves in Cagayan de Oro — Pueblo Golf Estates.\r\n\r\nWake up every morning to panoramic views of the lush fairway and enjoy the serene ambiance of golf course living.\r\n\r\nProperty Details:  \r\nLot Area:403 sqm  \r\nFloor Area: Approx. 540 sqm  \r\nBedrooms: 5 spacious rooms  \r\nBathrooms: 3.5  \r\nParking: Ample space available  \r\n\r\n\r\nPremium Features:* \r\nFloor-to-ceiling glass windows offering uninterrupted views of the golf course  \r\nRich wood finish for window panels, doors, jambs, and trims — exuding natural warmth and elegance  \r\nA relaxing lanai area perfect for afternoon coffee or weekend lounging while overlooking the fairway  \r\nExtra garden space —ensuring you always enjoy a wide, green open buffer zone  \r\nGenerous open-concept living and dining areas designed for entertaining, cool, well-ventilated interiors with an abundance of natural light.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhy Live in Pueblo Golf Estates?\r\n \r\nPueblo Golf Estates is a highly sought-after gated community in Uptown Cagayan de Oro, masterfully developed to blend luxury, leisure, and natural landscapes. It is anchored by the **Pueblo de Oro Golf & Country Club, a championship 18-hole golf course designed by renowned architect Robert Trent Jones II.  \r\n\r\nLiving here means:  \r\nYou're just minutes away from top schools like Xavier University – Ateneo de Cagayan and Corpus Christi  \r\nClose to SM City CDO Uptown, groceries, restaurants, banks, and lifestyle establishments  \r\nAccess to private hospitals (St. Francis Hospital) and clinics within a short drive  \r\nSafe, flood-free, and family-friendly neighborhood with 24/7 security",
